{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"t":"Test 3","w":0.064763921101888014,"x":0.067727027296809919,"y":0.04663144258496621,"c":1,"h":0.016421327574142497},{"c":1,"w":0.016494844754536955,"x":0.068041237334071733,"y":0.13808139525558105,"t":"E","h":0.01453488361674482},{"x":0.11546390877078967,"y":0.091569767166084781,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"t":"sketched intuitively, when a part of the physical universe is finally understood, its","w":0.81030929565429677},{"x":0.11340206725757061,"c":1,"y":0.11039342343271019,"t":"description often looks like a page in a mathematics text.","w":0.57525772094726557,"h":0.01614797416324143},{"x":0.11134021833675746,"t":"Still, the non-mathematical reader can go far in understanding mathematical","h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.77319585164388016,"y":0.13799177936548523,"c":1},{"h":0.017441861012089777,"w":0.78762888590494784,"y":0.15697674390948901,"x":0.113402051795602,"c":1,"t":"reasoning. This book presents the details that illustrate the mathematical style"},{"w":0.78568522135416652,"t":"of thinking, which involves sustained, step-by-step analysis, experiments, and","x":0.11334312722144176,"y":0.17423112108805794,"h":0.020658164883947894,"c":1},{"x":0.11134021604525741,"c":1,"t":"insights. You will turn these pages much more slowly than when reading a novel","y":0.19465648832599958,"h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.81237111409505203},{"w":0.82886596679687496,"y":0.21366279086446183,"x":0.11340206807144511,"c":1,"t":"or a newspaper. It may help to have a pencil and paper ready to check claims and","h":0.015988371754420583},{"t":"carry out experiments.","y":0.23253082809405956,"w":0.23092783610026046,"x":0.11340206127810394,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1},{"y":0.26012918415282038,"t":"As I wrote, I kept in mind two types of readers: those who enjoyed mathematics","h":0.019083969465648831,"x":0.11340205482331848,"w":0.80206186930338541,"c":1},{"w":0.8391752624511718,"y":0.27906976716551446,"c":1,"x":0.11340205942677169,"h":0.017465758309669566,"t":"until they were turned off by an unpleasant episode, usually around fifth grade, and"},{"y":0.29796511611947663,"w":0.78556701660156236,"h":0.018895349149765539,"t":"mathematics aficionados, who will find much that is new throughout the book.","c":1,"x":0.11340205862452166},{"c":1,"x":0.11340205309770227,"y":0.32703488344514853,"h":0.017441861012089777,"t":"This book also serves readers who simply want to sharpen their analytical skills.","w":0.81030929565429688},{"c":1,"x":0.11340205939271555,"t":"Many careers, such as law and medicine, require extended, precise analysis. Each","y":0.34439224949099034,"w":0.83917526245117202,"h":0.019083969465648831},{"w":0.82680414835611993,"c":1,"x":0.1134020494315135,"y":0.36337209274696491,"t":"chapter offers practice in following a sustained and closely argued line of thought.","h":0.017441861012089777},{"w":0.76288660685221366,"h":0.015989225189334544,"t":"That mathematics can develop this skill is shown by these two testimonials:","y":0.38226658859239282,"c":1,"x":0.11340205728190265},{"x":0.098918100618208299,"y":0.40843027934366782,"w":0.84547815958658845,"h":0.020806723038588881,"c":1,"t":"A physician wrote, 'The discipline of analytical thought processes [in mathematics]"},{"w":0.79793813069661457,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1,"y":0.42865531414662539,"x":0.11340206860953402,"t":"prepared me extremely well for medical school. In medicine one is faced with a"},{"w":0.81030929565429677,"x":0.11546390892023974,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"t":"problem which must be thoroughly analyzed before a solution can be found. The","y":0.44767441832531141},{"t":"process is similar to doing mathematics.'","y":0.46506878119996975,"x":0.11325728392253732,"h":0.020139724453687058,"w":0.41062296549479171,"c":1},{"x":0.1134020582472247,"c":1,"t":"A lawyer made the same point, 'Although I had no background in law - not even","w":0.8082474263509114,"h":0.01908396946564872,"y":0.49412800923227795},{"w":0.81030929565429677,"c":1,"x":0.11340205310612844,"h":0.015999467528293398,"y":0.51453488388788726,"t":"one political science course - did well at one of the best law schools. I attribute"},{"t":"much of my success there to having learned, through the study of mathematics,","x":0.1134020607936165,"h":0.018895349149765539,"y":0.53197674379357651,"w":0.8082474263509114,"c":1},{"x":0.11128322467038695,"y":0.54893418407336048,"h":0.02008120032247207,"c":1,"w":0.82073359171549487,"t":"and, in particular, theorems, how to analyze complicated principles. Lawyers who"},{"c":1,"y":0.56976744158438286,"w":0.84329895019531254,"h":0.017441861012089777,"t":"have studied mathematics can master the legal principles in a way that most others","x":0.11134021549911589},{"t":"cannot.'","h":0.017441859892096345,"y":0.58575581406557975,"c":1,"x":0.11134020704568366,"w":0.084536081949869793},{"y":0.61773255786362569,"c":1,"w":0.78144327799479163,"x":0.10927836089464307,"h":0.017441861012089777,"t":"Ihope you will share my delight in watching as simple, even naive, questions"},{"y":0.63505578415582908,"w":0.82268040974934886,"t":"lead to remarkable solutions and purely theoretical discoveries find unanticipated","x":0.10721649604563756,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.13055698394775392,"y":0.65311022029437316,"x":0.11106444839618504,"t":"applications.","h":0.01836496399069143},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"74","y":0.95348837197340164,"w":0.026804122924804691,"x":0.059793814731755726},{"h":0.022622550296839461,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.35218917374923969,"y":0.95429983585653255,"w":0.29143658955891932,"c":1}]}